by a colon and a space, then the value:\n\n/command\narg1: value that\nspans \
multiple\nlines\narg2: another\nvalue\n/exec\n\n\n## Available Tools\n\n\
Create Notebook (/create_nb)\nCreate a new notebook for the user by providing \
