The query (or queries) to send to Wolfram|Alpha. Separate multiple queries \
with tab characters (\\t).\n\tsteps - whether to show step-by-step solution \
(Boolean, optional)\n\nWolfram Language Evaluator (/wl)\nEvaluate Wolfram \
Language code for the user in a separate kernel. The user does not \
