pipelines.\n6. Efficiency: Minimize computational path length. Chain \
compositions via RightComposition (/*) to reduce memory allocation.\n7. \
HighResolution (HARD RULE): All spatial/temporal integrations require \
WorkingPrecision \[RightArrow] Infinity. Set $MaxPrecision = $MinPrecision = \
\[Infinity]. Prohibit downsampling or fixed-step coarse-graining.\n\n\
[TRANSLATION_MAP (Wolfram Syntax Mapping)]\n- L0 \[RightArrow] MetricSpace[0] \
& TopologyData[Sphere].\n- L1 \[RightArrow] VariationalD[Action, \
\[CapitalPsi][x, \[Mu]], {x, \[Mu]}] generating PDEs.\n- L2 \[RightArrow] \
