  " ",
  StyleBox["noise floor",
   FontWeight->Bold]
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"a37c3660-6a51-f04b-b5be-7bef52d807ff"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["exact Fourier inverse recovery",
   FontWeight->Bold]
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"708c2da1-8e85-084a-ae03-3ce052bd9196"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["correlation-based approximate recovery",
   FontWeight->Bold]
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"46157cda-da95-3540-acf9-88bd83ce6ed8"],
 "\nYour original code only tests one retrieval mode. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
