     "\\nu(x)=\\int K(x,y;R)\\,\\mathcal M[\\Psi](y)\\,dy", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "239c9a18-e603-0e47-9534-c72c2eab0678"],
 "\nor neighbor-induced: \n",
