(D[rho[x, tau], tau] - D[nu[x, tau], tau]) /. dynamicSystem\n};\n\n\
Print[Style[\"Signed-density balance law:\", Purple, Bold]];\n\
balanceEquations\n```\n\nNow simplify explicitly.\n\n```wl\nprintTestResult[\n\
  \"Expanded signed-density evolution\",\n  balanceEquations[[1, 2]] // \
Expand // Simplify\n];\n```\n\n---\n\n## 8. Central coherence tests\n\nThese \
tests are exact symbolic checks, not simulation.\n\n```wl\n\
Print[Style[\"Running central coherence tests...\", Darker[Green], Bold]];\n\n\
test1 = printTestResult[\n  \"Test 1: coherence identity well-defined\",\n  \
centralCoherence[x, tau] === psi[x, tau] - rho[x, tau] + nu[x, tau]\n];\n\n\
test2 = printTestResult[\n  \"Test 2: restoration equals anisotropy times \
