tau], tau] == centralCoherence[x, tau] + Subscript[u, r][x, tau]\n};\n\n\
Print[Style[\"Driven dynamic system:\", Purple, Bold]];\ndrivenDynamicSystem\n\
```\n\n---\n\n## 12. Runnable exact test suite\n\nEach test below prints a \
clear result.\n\n### Test A: Signed density definition\n\n```wl\n\
printTestResult[\n  \"Test A\",\n  signedDensity[x, tau] == rho[x, tau] - \
nu[x, tau]\n];\n```\n\n### Test B: Central coherence reduction\n\n```wl\n\
printTestResult[\n  \"Test B\",\n  centralCoherence[x, tau] /. \
equilibriumRules\n];\n```\n\n### Test C: Field-update factorization\n\n```wl\n\
printTestResult[\n  \"Test C\",\n  Factor[-measurementOperator[x, tau] + \
